{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d47a3c82ba5bcac29b97b12801663a441478f2a71545c7c53a86f22ff9a41bb4", "ja": "（エレナと美希のデュオ活動は順調だ。\n今日はこれから、生配信ライブが予定されている）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜和美希的双人活动进展顺利。今天接下来安排了直播演出）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "0204e6eaab4500262bae5a891cdc2fac63f15b18a774e558f19b7e3172e2b433", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nヤッホーだヨー！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n嗨——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a6b28640d205144ece8178815da7bf5c847c7bd511242398919063b3e9037969", "ja": "ヤッホー、エレナ。もう準備できたのか。\n……あれ、美希は？", "zh": "嗨，艾蕾娜。已经准备好了吗？\n……咦，美希呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "ba96a682e9ed647e9c1bb1f4975a8a25bafb12469c2892f453b9a27ceb42d7c4", "ja": "アレ？　まだ来てない？　ワタシより\n早く着替えてたけど……じゃあ、散歩かナー？", "zh": "咦？还没来吗？她明明比我更早换好衣服了……那是去散步了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c685d0fb11a1ff6d7554ba062fb821c3cb60a2315bd920878548201e503e2db0", "ja": "あれ、そうなのか？　せっかく\n早めに現場入りできたと思ったんだけどな。", "zh": "哎，是这样吗？亏我还以为\n总算能早点进现场了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "12bbe647d2f3110f0f8cc545714f1ce958e7db772ec2fcd34a945473c516de74", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だヨ、{$P$}。\n始まるまで、まだ時間あるし！", "zh": "不用担心，没关系的ヨ，{$P$}。\n离开始还有时间呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1006_p", "source_sha256": "100222996c5a97a668773e841ab729dfff221ba281c264d1c38f3c914011e929", "ja": "そうだけど、気まぐれは困るかな……。\nせめて声を掛けてくれないと、心配するだろ？", "zh": "虽然是这样，不过你突然随心所欲地行动，我会很为难的……\n至少也该跟我说一声吧，不然我会担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "b482f7adfeb40c3932a52ccfc0b9860e916a0470872da402e77114498c629cb8", "ja": "ダイジョーブ！　ミキは絶対、戻ってくるノ。\nワタシ、ずっと見てたからわかるヨ♪", "zh": "没问题！美希一定会回来的。因为我一直看着她，所以知道哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "3e66533ea344954417199071a3067e520a9efeccd046955b028bfb7382eece85", "ja": "ミキは眠そうな時でも仕事はキチンとするし、\n勝手にどこか遠くに行ったりもしないヨー。", "zh": "美希就算困得睁不开眼，也会好好工作的，而且也不会擅自跑到什么很远的地方去哦——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1009_p", "source_sha256": "992764c256bffbbe75e3c56780ff585d7dd7de9428475f5fd0f6c160acc46640", "ja": "もちろん、信用してないわけじゃないんだ。\nただ、ちょっと心配なだけで……。", "zh": "我当然不是不信任你。\n只是有点担心而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "ec67e9d79e975b7c935a539eb8e854f497a74f5dd4f10af6faded10207ad8abe", "ja": "エヘヘ。{$P$}、\nミキがいなくて寂しいんだネ？　ワタシに任せて！", "zh": "嘿嘿。{$P$}，没有美希在身边，很寂寞吧？交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "eafca896dc08e2a21a92d71b33b7ee4d7fb3f60aa462b22e7af118d3564f7da3", "ja": "さっき、おなか減ってるって言ってたし。\nここにおにぎり置いておけば、出てくると思うヨ。", "zh": "刚才不是说肚子饿了吗？\n只要把饭团放在这里，我想就会出来了哟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cba0cc663207b054321be9973249d0c5629ea5e10b7accbe02a756e7b041f439", "ja": "そんな野生動物みたいな……。", "zh": "像野生动物一样似的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "a65e49a020123353724e7076ed7970dc9eb9b90d11feeddcd378a7eb6f978986", "ja": "じゃあ、罠も置いておく？　たとえば\n床のこのへんに、大きなワッカを作って～……。", "zh": "那要不要也设置个陷阱？比如在地板这附近，做一个大大的圈～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4f07dd1a77f952e4f6ec23b05f7e6053eb0b8601676ef56d9de159681f1ffe9f", "ja": "いや、そこまでは……。美希が来たら、\nエレナが捕まえてくれたらいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不，倒也不用做到那份上……等美希来了，\n艾莲娜帮我抓住她不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "f15ef3abb687d6d5e0acea117f76093e16bd56e44f14ec0901269d43bfb9b057", "ja": "うん！　わかったヨ。\nワタシがハグで、ぎゅーってつかまえてあげるネ♪", "zh": "嗯！知道啦。我会用拥抱紧紧把她抓住哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "a3d10af42024c287fffe19d8da6e9b8fee20de774f088dc695e562997cf13f75", "ja": "ん？　……あっ！　{$P$}、\nあそこにいるの、ミキだよネ！？", "zh": "嗯？……啊！{$P$}，在那边的是美希吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1017_p", "source_sha256": "52a038243c1a0c03d25ed921565188fe5367cd23fc9f96568a85ae157350873f", "ja": "え？　あ、本当だ。\nお～い、美希……。", "zh": "咦？啊，真的耶。\n喂——美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "65919ed1bce2a2913774b66f4b531b7b512b4745ca3adafe3c5a2c85158c4e61", "ja": "ダメだよ{$P$}、ワタシにまかせて\nって言ったでしょ？　エレナ捕獲隊、出動だヨ～。", "zh": "不行哦，{$P$}，我不是说了交给我吗？埃莱娜捕捉队，出动啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0263_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2d3c7fd403d5f10e3ca8fbb61a95484ca7da11f06a2622959769c79b1d601573", "ja": "（デュオを経て、エレナは頼もしくなった気がするな。\nこれなら今日の生放送も、安心して任せられそうだ！）", "zh": "（经历了二人组合之后，感觉艾蕾娜变得可靠多了。这样一来，今天的直播也能放心交给她了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
